# Strix pentest runs. Findings embed source excerpts, request/response bodies, and
# whatever secrets the agent recovered — never commit them. The throwaway scan
# database is disposable: rebuild it with `python -m app.seed` against
# LUMOS_DATABASE_URL rather than tracking it.
strix_runs/
backend/lumos-strix.db

